2. Core Components (Atomic Design)

Atoms
	•	Button / Primary → navy background, white text, rounded-lg, padding 12x24
	•	Button / Secondary → outline navy, text navy
	•	Select / Dropdown → label above, rounded, arrow icon
	•	Tag → rounded-full, small text, background accent color
	•	Icon → Lucide icons, line weight 2px

Molecules
	•	Filter Group → group of Selects + Apply button
	•	Player Card → photo or silhouette, name, team, metric score bar
	•	Stat Row → metric name, value, horizontal bar indicator

Organisms
	•	Rankings Table → header row sticky, zebra striping, sort arrows
	•	Plotly Chart Frame → dark navy background, rounded-lg, padding 16
	•	Player Header → left: player image + info; right: top 3 metrics

